                        "title": "How to change the message on the last commit in git?",
                        "slug": "how-to-change-the-message-on-last-commit-in-git",
                        "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">git commit --amend\n# follow prompts to change the commit message</code></pre><p>Stupid commit message formatting requirements.</p><p class=\"git-article-source\">Originally Posted On: <a href=\"http://ohshitgit.com/\">OhShitGit</a></p><div class=\"kg-card kg-signup-card\"><h2>Subscribe</h2><form data-members-form=\"signup\"><input type=\"email\"></form></div>",
