                        "title": "Fuck this noise, I give up",
                        "slug": "fuck-this-noise-i-give-up",
                        "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">cd ..\nrm -rf fucking-git-repo-dir\ngit clone https://some.github.url/fucking-git-repo-dir.git\ncd fucking-git-repo-dir</code></pre><p>Thanks to Eric V. for this one.</p>",
